        "text": "def tailDebt (d : TailData) : ℝ := (∫ t in (0:ℝ)..3, Real.exp ((1 - d.h) * t) * tailShapeDeriv d t) / (1 - d.rho)   -- Q_p, defined by the evaluated form; tailDebt_source_formula proves it equal to the paper's integral"
